  "description": "Yun-Ho is a vocalist of a rock band with a painful past of losing all of his family in a car accident when he was just a little boy. One day, Yun-Ho went to a gathering to hear that his beloved Gyeong-Hun, who has always consoled him in his dark days, had fallen in love with another man.\n\nYun-Ho runs out from shock and bumps into a mysterious man, Han-Ul who happens to be a mythical tiger. When they run into each other, Han-Ul senses a sweet scent coming from Yun-Ho, and although Han-Ul has never been interested in humans he finds himself intrigued by Yun-Ho.\n\n(Source: Netcomics)",
